# Answerly — Full Project Walkthrough

> A modern, bilingual Q&A and quiz platform built with **Next.js 15**, **TypeScript**, **Tailwind CSS v4**, **shadcn/ui**, **MongoDB** (Mongoose), and **PostgreSQL** (Sequelize).

---

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Client["Client (React 18)"]
        Pages["Pages & Layouts"]
        Components["21 Custom Components"]
        UI["67 shadcn/ui Components"]
        Hooks["Custom Hooks"]
        LibClient["Client-side Lib"]
    end
    subgraph API["Next.js API Routes (15+)"]
        AuthAPI["Auth Routes"]
        QuizAPI["Quiz Routes"]
        QuestionsAPI["Questions Routes"]
        CatAPI["Categories Routes"]
        LeaderboardAPI["Leaderboard Routes"]
        HistoryAPI["History Routes"]
        UsersAPI["User Routes"]
    end
    subgraph Server["Server Layer"]
        Controllers["Controllers (10)"]
        Services["Services (14)"]
        Models["Models (10)"]
        Middleware["Middleware (2)"]
    end
    subgraph DB["Databases"]
        MongoDB
        PostgreSQL
    end
    Pages --> Components
    Components --> UI
    Components --> Hooks
    Components --> LibClient
    LibClient --> API
    API --> Controllers
    Controllers --> Services
    Services --> Models
    Models --> DB
```

