## API Routes (`/app/api`)

| Route | Methods | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `/api/auth/login` | POST | Authenticate user, return JWT token |
| `/api/auth/register` | POST | Create new user account |
| `/api/auth/me` | GET | Get current user from JWT |
| `/api/auth/forgot-password` | POST | Send password reset email via Nodemailer |
| `/api/auth/reset-password` | POST | Reset password with token |
| `/api/categories` | GET, POST, PUT, DELETE | Full CRUD on hierarchical categories (supports `?tree=true`, `?parentId=`, `?level=`) |
| `/api/categories/trending` | GET | Trending topics with question counts and bilingual data |
| `/api/subcategories` | GET | Fetch subcategories by parent |
| `/api/questions` | GET, POST | List questions (supports filters), create new question |
| `/api/questions/random` | GET | Random questions for quiz |
| `/api/questions/by-category` | GET | Questions filtered by category/subcategory |
| `/api/quiz` | POST | Start quiz (`action=start`), submit quiz (`action=submit`), get history (`action=history`) |
| `/api/quiz/results` | POST | Save detailed quiz results with auth |
| `/api/quiz/sessions` | GET | Get quiz session data |
| `/api/history` | GET | User quiz history |
| `/api/leaderboard` | GET | Global and per-category leaderboard data |
| `/api/progress` | GET | User progress stats |
| `/api/users` | GET, PUT | User profile and update |
| `/api/users/avatar` | POST | Avatar upload |
| `/api/upload-json` | POST | Bulk JSON question import |
| `/api/seed` | POST | Seed database with sample data |

