## Lib Layer (`/lib`)

| Module | File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **db** | [db.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/db.ts) | MongoDB connector via Mongoose. Caches the connection globally to prevent multiple connections in dev. Configurable pool size and timeout. |
| **categories** | [categories.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/categories.ts) | Client-side API wrapper for category CRUD: `fetchCategories`, `fetchCategoryTree`, `ensureCategory`, `createCategory`, `updateCategory`, `deleteCategory`. |
| **topics** | [topics.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/topics.ts) | Bilingual topic manager with `Localized<T>` type. Fetches trending topics from API with fallback to 6 static topics (Web Dev, AI/ML, Best Practices, Product Design, DevOps, Beginner Questions). |
| **questions** | [questions.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/questions.ts) | Defines `Question` type with `QuestionType` (MCQ, T/F, Code, Open-ended) and `Difficulty` (easy/medium/hard/beginner/intermediate/advanced). Client-side fallback to in-memory store. |
| **quiz** | [quiz.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/quiz.ts) | `startQuiz()` and `submitQuiz()` — API wrappers for the quiz flow. Supports category, subcategory, difficulty, limit, and question type filters. |
| **quiz-results** | [quiz-results.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/quiz-results.ts) | Defines `QuizResult` and `QuizAnswer` types. `saveQuizResult()` posts results to API with JWT auth. |
| **history** | [history.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/history.ts) | Dual storage — API-backed `getUserHistory()` for logged-in users, and `localStorage`-based `getHistory()`/`addHistoryItem()` for guests. Caps local history at 50 items. |
| **progress** | [progress.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/progress.ts) | In-memory key-value store tracking `{attempts, correct}` per question. Used by `QuestionCard` for auto-save. |
| **answer-evaluator** | [answer-evaluator.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/answer-evaluator.ts) | Open-ended answer grading engine using **Levenshtein distance** similarity + **keyword matching**. Scores 0-100 with weighted formula (60% keyword match + 40% similarity). Includes keyword extraction utility. |
| **subcategories** | [subcategories.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/subcategories.ts) | API wrapper for subcategory fetch by parent. |
| **api/questions** | [api/questions.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/api/questions.ts) | Higher-level API client for questions — `createQuestionApi()` with full validation and error handling. |
| **api/categories** | [api/categories.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/api/categories.ts) | API client for category operations. |
| **utils** | [utils.ts](file:///d:/Next.js-projects/answarly/lib/utils.ts) | Utility functions including `cn()` (clsx + tailwind-merge). |

