## Server Layer (`/server`)

### Models (10 Mongoose schemas)

| Model | File | Fields |
|---|---|---|
| **User** | `user.model.ts` | username, email, password (hashed), avatarUrl |
| **Question** | `question.model.ts` | question, type, options, answer, code, category, subcategory, reason, difficulty |
| **Category** | `category.model.ts` | name, description, parent, level, path[], isActive |
| **Subcategory** | `subcategory.model.ts` | name, parent (ref to Category) |
| **Quiz** | `quiz.model.ts` | userId, categoryId, difficulty, questions, score |
| **QuizSession** | `quiz-session.model.ts` | userId, category, difficulty, questions, answers, score, totalQuestions, correctAnswers, timeSpent |
| **History** | `history.model.ts` | userId, score, totalQuestions, correctAnswers, answers[] |
| **Progress** | `progress.model.ts` | userId, questionId, attempts, correct |
| **Feedback** | `feedback.model.ts` | userId, questionId, rating, comment |
| **PasswordReset** | `passwordReset.model.ts` | userId, token, expiresAt |

### Services (14 business logic modules)

| Service | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **auth.service** | Register, login, password hashing (bcrypt), JWT token generation/verification |
| **user.service** | User CRUD, profile updates |
| **user.filesystem.service** | File-based user avatar management, image processing |
| **category.service** | Category CRUD, tree-building, path computation |
| **categories.service** | Category listing and filtering |
| **subcategories.service** | Subcategory operations |
| **questions.service** | Question CRUD, filtering by category/type/difficulty |
| **quiz.service** | Quiz generation — random question selection with filters |
| **quiz-session.service** | Quiz session lifecycle — create, update, complete, scoring |
| **leaderboard.service** | Aggregate rankings by score/attempts across users |
| **progress.service** | User progress tracking and statistics |
| **history.service** | Quiz history storage and retrieval |
| **passwordReset.service** | Password reset token generation and validation |
| **upload-json.service** | Bulk JSON question import and validation |

### Middleware

| Middleware | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **auth** | JWT verification, extracts `userId` from token and attaches to request |
| **error** | Global error handler for API routes |

