## Design System

### Color Palette
- **Primary gradient**: `from-fuchsia-600 via-indigo-600 to-pink-600`
- **Light background**: `from-white via-[#f7f7fb] to-[#f0f3ff]`
- **Dark background**: `from-[#0a0b1a] via-[#101231] to-[#171a3f]`
- **Card surfaces**: `bg-white/90 dark:bg-white/5` with `border-white/60 dark:border-white/10`

### Typography
- **Font**: Inter (Google Fonts)
- **Headings**: `font-bold tracking-tight`

### Animations (defined in `globals.css`)
- `float` — Vertical bobbing (6s ease-in-out)
- `glow` — Pulsating indigo box-shadow (2s alternate)
- `shimmer` — Sliding highlight gradient (2s infinite)
- `pulse-slow` — Gentle opacity pulse (3s)

### Glassmorphism Pattern
```css
bg-white/90 dark:bg-white/5
border border-white/60 dark:border-white/10
backdrop-blur-sm
rounded-2xl shadow-sm
```

